 "readMeFirst": [
  "This is the single highest-value artifact in the pack. 15 status keys drive badge form, badge weight, tone, the card's primary action, and the detail record.",
  "series: 1 = unfinished (user owes something), 2 = matching/quote lifecycle, 3 = engaged/concluded.",
  "form: light | solid. Weight and form rules are ratified in DR-X-006.",
  "lifecycleBadge: what the badge collapses to on the calm surfaces. Only the two transient SmartMatch states keep their own badge.",
  "decisionStatus open = print it into Figma with an OPEN marker; the decision happens on the Figma canvas with the CEO, not here."
 ],
